    {
      "rowId": "openlayers.formats-projections-filters",
      "assertion": "OpenGeo and independent OpenLayers 10.10.0 parse and write the declared GeoJSON, WKT, and WKB/EWKB browser profile, agree on bounded authoritative CRS and axis-order fixtures, and exchange the declared bounded WFS BBOX, ResourceId, equality, governed During, and conjunction filters while unsupported filters fail closed."
    },
    {
      "rowId": "openlayers.sources-protocols",
      "assertion": "OpenLayers 10.10.0 natively reads authenticated GML 3.2 and performs one bounded WFS 2 insert, version-aware update, and delete through the governed service; a stale update returns 409, locks fail closed, and the upstream insert-receipt parser loss is explicit."
